  "description": "<div style=\"font-family: Poppins;\"><div><p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">• Brand introduction: Founder Penny was inspired by peppermint liqueurs she had whilst on travels in Berlin, but back in the UK struggled to find a modern brand that wasn't green or overly sweet, and so POLAR was born.&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">• Product description: POLAR Peppermint Ice Liqueur is a premium, British made spirit, perfect for drinking chilled on it's own or in a range of cocktails, from the POLAR Spritz to the After Eight Martini. It's designed to be enjoyed amongst friends in the same way the brand idea was born.&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">• USP (Unique Selling Point): The only British and premium made peppermint liqueur available in the market, making it completely unique. Female owned business. A premium liqueur that can be sipped neat without any of the usual harshness.&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">• Payment terms: Affiliates are paid within 30 days after the statutory 28 day return period following a successful referral. Affiliates will not be paid for any orders which are returned and refunded.&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">• Other information: Vegan friendly and gluten free. Uses all natural flavourings and a premium sugar beet grain base spirit, which is what gives POLAR it's smooth and delicious palate.&nbsp;</p></div></div>",
